  {
   "id": "is-this-seat-taken-329865@major-2025-11-17",
   "gameId": "is-this-seat-taken-329865",
   "displayName": "Language update is OUT NOW! 🗣🗣",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-11-17T18:00:53.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45469366/2dbfd17fa916e35cbd0d41b1551b5dfe31898e8c.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Hey everyone! 👋✨️",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "First things first, we would like to thank you all for the feedback and the love you have sent us our way - It truly helps, motivates and inspires us for our current title and the creation of new titles.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Here’s what’s new",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We have added 8 new languages to the game, so more players can enjoy the adventures of Nat in their preferred language! For the curious ones, these would be the new languages: Portuguese (Portugal), Traditional Chinese, Korean, Thai, Italian, Dutch, Ukrainian and Czech.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "We have also fixed bugs that our beloved community reported! (thank you so much for the help ❤)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "[dynamiclink href=\"https://youtu.be/7Wug30ZZaZs\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Cozy Quest Event 🥳🎊",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We are super excited to announce that “Is This Seat Taken?” will be part of the Cozy Quest Event by Secret Mode!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45469366/a5f6bf6b40db42c6c6b5047a7d12c83e64dec50f.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Cozy Quest is all about celebrating relaxing adventures and warm vibes! For more information about the event, you can find it here: Cozy Quest 2025 🔎",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "To celebrate it, we have a promotion of 20% off during the event days! We also partnered with our buddies at Endflame to make a bundle that includes “Is This Seat Taken?” and “Instants”, a puzzle game where you arrange the pictures in the correct order to piece together their most cherished memories! Find the link for the bundle here: Bundle 🔎",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[dynamiclink href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/bundle/62771\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "What's next 👀",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "##",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We currently don’t have any plans to add more content to the game. For now, we would like to focus on prototyping, developing and testing ideas for new games with funny twists, so it brings joyful moments for our community!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you once again for playing and for supporting the game and we hope you enjoy this new update!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45469366/5b65944958d9a8a2bdbeb60a86eeafaca287ba89.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
